supposed to be saying yes to.

00:24:12.258 --> 00:24:13.590
And the problem is, people don't know

00:24:13.590 --> 00:24:14.430
the theme of their life.

00:24:14.430 --> 00:24:18.480
So for me, my theme is
storytelling, integrity,

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:22.863
and fighting for those who are oppressed.

00:24:23.890 --> 00:24:25.760
Those are my themes.

00:24:25.760 --> 00:24:28.710
So I know what to say yes to,
and I know what to say no to.

00:24:28.710 --> 00:24:31.530
I know what to pass to, even if someone

00:24:31.530 --> 00:24:34.280
