00:55:40.210 --> 00:55:41.750
And in those darkest moments,

00:55:41.750 --> 00:55:43.680
you'll see those people being the ones

00:55:43.680 --> 00:55:46.280
that are leaned upon
because we actually know

00:55:46.280 --> 00:55:50.090
our way through the darkness, right?

00:55:50.090 --> 00:55:53.860
So that's the, when I have hope I go,

00:55:53.860 --> 00:55:57.713
man we were born for something,
we were born for dark days,

00:55:59.160 --> 00:56:01.930
and when those dark days
come, they're gonna come.

00:56:01.930 --> 00:56:06.773
I hope we are united enough as
people to lead the right way.

00:56:08.976 --> 00:56:11.476
- That's some fresh work.
- Well said, well said.

00:56:12.380 --> 00:56:14.520
Well I appreciate both
of you being on here

00:56:14.520 --> 00:56:18.000
